OL,3,GNEWSAMan who raped two teenagers jailed
OL,4,Afor 17 years
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man who raped two teenage girls has
OL,7,Fbeen sentenced to 17 years in jail.
OL,9,FKieren Chadwick-Tattersall, 34, from
OL,10,FSittingbourne in Kent, targeted the
OL,11,Fgirls, who were both aged 15 at the
OL,12,Ftime, between June and September 2024,
OL,13,Faccording to Kent Police.
OL,15,FPolice said he talked to the girls
OL,16,Fseparately on social media and took
OL,17,Fthem to secluded locations in his car
OL,18,Fwhere he would rape them and force them
OL,19,Fto engage in sexual activity.
OL,23,APub: 20-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
