OL,3,GNEWSAMan who raped two teenagers jailed
OL,4,Afor 17 years
OL,5,
OL,6,FHe pleaded guilty to charges including
OL,7,Frape, sexual activity with a child and
OL,8,Fsexual communication with a child at
OL,9,FMaidstone Crown Court on 9 July and was
OL,10,Fsentenced on Monday.
